| `Armor_Head` | Helmets |
| `Armor_Chest` | Chestplates |
| `Armor_Hands` | Gauntlets |
| `Armor_Legs` | Leggings |

Higher-tier materials require higher bench tiers:

| Material Tier | Required Bench Tier |
|---------------|---------------------|
