## HytaleServerConfig

<Aside type="caution" title="Changed in Update 3">
Several inner configuration classes were extracted from `HytaleServerConfig` into standalone files: `BackupConfig`, `ModConfig`, `RateLimitConfig`, and `UpdateConfig`. If you were referencing these as inner classes (e.g., `HytaleServerConfig.RateLimitConfig`), you must update your imports to the new standalone classes in `com.hypixel.hytale.server.core.config`. The [Update 3 changelog](/changelog/update-2-to-3/) has the full list of breaking changes.
